;; resources/valueflows/vocabulary.edn is GENERATED from all_vf.ttl by
;; bin/ingest.cljk. Neither file is hand-edited. To take a new upstream
;; release: replace all_vf.ttl, update :sha256 / :fetched-at / :bytes here,
;; re-run `nbb bin/ingest.cljk`, and read the diff.
;;
;; :sha256 is what makes "which Valueflows" answerable. Without it the EDN
;; would claim to be the spec while being whatever someone last edited.

