  :bytes          87877
  :fetched-at     "2026-08-15"
  :license        "Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (upstream declares cc:license)"}

 ;; Why the raw TTL and not the rendered HTML: the action behaviour table —
 ;; the operative part of the vocabulary, the one that says what `produce`
 ;; does to an inventory — is published on
 ;; https://www.valueflo.ws/concepts/actions/ as a PNG. It is machine-readable
 ;; only in the TTL. A mirror built from the HTML would have had to
 ;; transcribe an image by eye, i.e. invent it.
 :why-ttl "the action behaviour table is an image in the HTML and RDF in the TTL"

 ;; Recorded because a name is not evidence of ownership (the same
 ;; distinction manifest/origin-domains.edn draws).
